<title>JAPAN: NYMEX oil futures rebound on ACCESS in thin trade.</title>
<headline>NYMEX oil futures rebound on ACCESS in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crude prices gained 14 cents in overnight ACCESS trading on Monday after falling to a 15-month low at Friday's NYMEX close.</p>
<p>July WTI crude futures bounced back to $18.91 in thin trade as a handful of participants jumped back into a market pushed ever-lower Friday by rising U.S. inventories and record refinery production over the last month.</p>
</text>
